    "OutOfScopeItem": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "An item the user asked for that is not a standard category (\"블랙 부츠\" -> 부츠), decision IT-7.\nIt is not turned into an item (that would widen the search to every category); its own conditions are\nkept as raw text in `conditions_raw` (the 블랙 of \"블랙 부츠랑 셔츠\" belongs to 부츠, not to 셔츠).",
