    "TrendTerms": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Query-wide terms (decision IT-5″).\n\n`seasons` (decision SQ-2, 2026-11-11): every season the user named, in query order, never empty - a query\nnaming no season gets the one `default_next` season. Duplicates (same year and season) are removed.\n`product_model_names` (decision SQ-1, renamed from `item_terms`): specific product / model names that no\nstandard category or attribute can express (e.g. a model name); items the user asks for are in `items`.",
      "properties": {
        "product_model_names": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/TermRef"
          },
          "title": "Product Model Names",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "seasons": {
